From: OG OS <og-os@invalid>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:41:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Build the editor crates for Android

cfg(target_os = "android") where the desktop code assumes a desktop: file watching, paths,
spawning processes (refused on Android), the default keymap and settings, and
workspace close handling.
